===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|sibunzehan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*sebuntehun}}. Compare Dutch {{term|zeventien|lang=nl}}, West Frisian {{term|santjin|lang=fy}}, English {{term|seventeen|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|sytten|lang=da}}, Gothic [[𐍃𐌹𐌱𐌿𐌽𐍄𐌰𐌹𐌷𐌿𐌽]] (sibuntaihun).

